everal attacks, the next attack deals more damage"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":6500,"atk":500,"def":200,"res":40,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"nightzmora_follower":{"slug":"nightzmora_follower","name":"Nightzmora Follower","icon":"/enemies-icons/Nightzmora Follower.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Pretenders who began following Nightmare Knight after his battles and 'Performance Art'. Many attempt to guess at the true identity of the Nightzmora from ancient texts and history books, even though he himself considers it blasphemy against the ancient rituals.","abilities":["[Coalescing Fear] Deals Physical damage to all operators with no visibility directly behind them"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":15000,"atk":1500,"def":750,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":5}},"the_last_kheshig_tola":{"slug":"the_last_kheshig_tola","name":"'The Last Kheshig', Tola","icon":"/enemies-icons/'The Last Kheshig', Tola.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"The Nightzmora has never acknowledged his knightly title. The city and civilization itself are nothing but obstacles on his path of conquest. The meaning modern Kazimierz bestows upon the knights represents a total desecration of his history to which he is so devoted.","abilities":["[Coalescing Fear] Deals Physical damage to all operators with no visibility directly behind them"],"levelCount":2,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":80000,"atk":1500,"def":1200,"res":40,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":5}},"damazti_cluster_enemy_1542_wdslm":{"slug":"damazti_cluster_enemy_1542_wdslm","na